{"id":"d685a2bfe849b672","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-spectral-measure.md","title":"Spectral Measure","display":"df-spectral-measure — Spectral Measure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-spectral-measure","aliases":["58-df-spectral-measure"],"display":"df-spectral-measure — Spectral Measure","depends_on":["[[58-df-projector-valued]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-spectral-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-spectral-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-spectral-measure — Spectral Measure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4366f310672969df\" href=\"?note=4366f310672969df\" title=\"58-df-projector-valued\">58-df-projector-valued</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,E,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle\\in V\">\\(H,E,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E:\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)\\to\\mathcal L(H)\">\\(E:\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)\\to\\mathcal L(H)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PVM}_S(E,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\">\\(\\mathrm{PVM}_S(E,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4366f310672969df\" href=\"?note=4366f310672969df\" title=\"58-df-projector-valued\">58-df-projector-valued</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SpectralMeasure}_S(E,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\">\\(\\mathrm{SpectralMeasure}_S(E,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\)</span>（本文件定义的三元谱测度谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}spectral\\text{-}measure} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{SpectralMeasure}_S(E,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PVM}_S(E,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}spectral\\text{-}measure} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{SpectralMeasure}_S(E,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PVM}_S(E,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>谱测度把规范 Borel <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-代数映到由同一个内积确定的正交投影，并具有强算子拓扑下的可列可加性；第三参数不能误传为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)\">\\(\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>谱定理为每个自伴算子产生相应谱测度；一个未指定算子的谱测度不能被描述为“已经对角化某个给定算子”。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-projector-valued","status":"resolved","id":"4366f310672969df","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-projector-valued]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-projector-valued","status":"resolved","id":"4366f310672969df","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PVM}_S(E,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)$（see [[58-df-projector-valued]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"H,E,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"E:\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)\\to\\mathcal L(H)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PVM}_S(E,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SpectralMeasure}_S(E,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}spectral\\text{-}measure} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{SpectralMeasure}_S(E,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PVM}_S(E,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)","display":false}],"bytes":1132,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1204","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-spectral-measure.md|58-df-spectral-measure]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["4366f310672969df"]}